From: nocmt <nocmtone@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:00:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Share legacy controller glyph mapping through upstream
 GameController bridges

Recover the tracked helper from 7463eba (inherited from bc5815a), absent from the exported legacy patch. Keep vendor auto-detection and DM_PADMAP=nintendo|xbox, including a working explicit Xbox override. Keep the existing Mac/iOS controller publishing and disconnect paths; do not revive front_gamepad_mac.m. Test vendor detection, overrides and every face-button combination.
